Mrs.[ Sed]berry was preceded in death by her parents and brother, Cleavern Broussard, III. She is survived by her loving husband, Charles[ Sed]berry, daughter, Betty Irene[ Sed]berry, two grandsons, Charles and Aaron[ Sed]berry, sister, Doris Broussard Michelli, brother, Donald Broussard, many[ cousins], nie[ces],[ nephew]s. She is also survived by several whom she saw as and claimed as daughters, sons, and grandchildren. She will be[ dearly] missed.
